.PP
If you intend to log off the system before the command completes you
must run the command immune to
\s-2HANGUP\s0
signals.
This is done by placing the word
`nohup' before each program in the command, i.e.:
.DS
nohup man csh \||\| nohup lpr &
.DE
.PP
